        <type>Marmot::Math::Tensors::Tensor322d</type>
        <definition>Marmot::Math::Tensors::Tensor322d Marmot::ContinuumMechanics::PlaneStress::compute_dStress_dDeformationGradient</definition>
        <argsstring>(const Marmot::Math::Tensors::Tensor633d &amp;dStressdDeformationGradient3D)</argsstring>
        <name>compute_dStress_dDeformationGradient</name>
        <qualifiedname>Marmot::ContinuumMechanics::PlaneStress::compute_dStress_dDeformationGradient</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const Marmot::Math::Tensors::Tensor633d &amp;</type>
          <declname>dStressdDeformationGradient3D</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Computes the plane stress derivative of the stress with respect to the deformation gradient. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Reduces the 3D derivative of the stress tensor with respect to the deformation gradient <formula id="102">$ F_{ij} $</formula> to a plane stress setting.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>dStressdDeformationGradient3D</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Derivative of 3D stress w.r.t. deformation gradient ( <formula id="103">$6 \times 3 \times 3$</formula> tensor). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Reduced derivative of stress w.r.t. deformation gradient ( <formula id="104">$3 \times 2 \times 2$</formula> tensor) for plane stress. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
