        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Computes the transformation matrix for the plane stress tangent. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns the 6x6 transformation matrix <formula id="109">$\mathbf{T}$</formula> relating arbitrary strain increments to plane stress increments using the material stiffness.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>tangent</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>6x6 material tangent stiffness matrix ( <formula id="110">$\mathbf{C}$</formula>). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>6x6 transformation matrix ( <formula id="109">$\mathbf{T}$</formula>) for plane stress correction. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
